# Prompt governance

- **Classes:** canonical (approved operational), reference (useful, not authoritative), archive (superseded). Store under prompts/canonical, prompts/reference, prompts/archive, or document the location in docs/prompts-reference.md.
- Every prompt file must have **purpose and status**; inventory in docs/prompts-reference.md.
- **Promote:** repeated workflows → Skills; stable repo law → Rules; narrow specialist review → Subagents. See docs/prompt-governance.md.
- Prompt packs in docs/Reference are **reference only** unless docs/prompts-reference.md marks them canonical.
